{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Talk to your neighbours, get entangled in local shenanigans, and uncover a town mystery in this cozy coming of age game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as 16-year-old Naomi with an MP3 player full of 2000s inspired tracks. While doing odd jobs to raise the cash to fix her car, Naomi meets quirky neighbours and gets entangled in local drama. How you play and respond to characters shapes who Naomi becomes over the summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHAPE THE WORLD THROUGH MUSIC</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With  your MP3 player, you can change the way you experience the world. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music you choose shapes the environment, dialogue choices, and your skating style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.poster.avif?t=1758244452\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.webm?t=1758244452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/962f3a485d469948f86664d48158b873.mp4?t=1758244452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROLLERBLADE ACROSS TOWN</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your rollerblades and navigate the scenic streets of your small town.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and find your place in the neighbourhood; maybe pick up a few tricks along the way!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/8f2e0d2891ffda22787d71e0e325d2aa.poster.avif?t=1758244452\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/8f2e0d2891ffda22787d71e0e325d2aa.webm?t=1758244452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/8f2e0d2891ffda22787d71e0e325d2aa.mp4?t=1758244452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A FORMATIVE ADVENTURE</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn enough money to fix up your car by doing odd jobs for your eclectic neighbours. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run errands, uncover lost items, strike up fun conversations, and get swept up in shenanigans with local troublemakers. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/452dd27b192eac0e147d81c3eacd41da.poster.avif?t=1758244452\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/452dd27b192eac0e147d81c3eacd41da.webm?t=1758244452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/extras/452dd27b192eac0e147d81c3eacd41da.mp4?t=1758244452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kinds of small town adventures will you discover?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2828540?t=1758244452","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap