"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828540/198e097683275fd3cf123f621226fc5fe3d624e6/ss_198e097683275fd3cf123f621226fc5fe3d624e6.600x338.jpg?t=1758244452"}],"short_description":"Immerse yourself in this relaxing slice-of-life adventure and explore a small town as a teenage girl on rollerblades. Shuffle through your MP3 player and set the mood for your summer as you run errands for quirky neighbours and get entangled in local drama.","steam_appid":2828540,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://rollergirlgame.com/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://rollergirlgame.com/"}